      "places_and_activities": "She enjoys walkable cities with good public transit, bookstores, food markets, museums, and distinct neighborhoods. She also likes coastal walks, forest trails, and a comfortable cabin for a short reset. She is happy with a moderate hike but does not seek strenuous outdoor challenges as the point of a vacation.",
