      "past_trip": "On a nine-day trip with a close friend to Montreal and Quebec City, they stayed in two places and took the train between them. Grace liked having time to revisit a neighborhood, browse a market, and sit down for meals instead of treating each day as a checklist. They had different morning rhythms, so they sometimes went out separately and met later; she found that arrangement easier than trying to synchronize every hour.",
